package design

// The [[.Name]]'s Story says, in Highbay's Story language, who uses the
// [[.Name]] and which paths their requests take. It is empty: the first
// change declares it in this file with Story, after changing the import below
// to
//
//	import . "github.com/goadesign/highbay/story/dsl"
//
// Highbay evaluates the Story when the guide calls refresh_story, and keeps it
// with a change when the guide proposes or revises that change with the
// refresh's op_id (story_refresh_op_id). Every finished flow (one with a
// start, an outcome and no open question) is a test each build of a change
// requires: a flow with the key places-order becomes the scenario
// places_order of the evaluation suite in eval/, which the method PlacesOrder
// of package eval/acceptance runs. A flow's key must not repeat a scenario
// the suite in eval/ already declares by hand. The command
// go doc github.com/goadesign/highbay/story/dsl lists the language.
import _ "github.com/goadesign/highbay/story/dsl"
